<title>POLAND: WOLCZANKA FEB NET FALLS TO PLN 0.4 MLN.</title>
<headline>WOLCZANKA FEB NET FALLS TO PLN 0.4 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results February</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>FEBRUARY</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.36 vs   0.42</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 0.70 vs   0.90</p>
<p> Operating profit     0.69 vs   0.79</p>
<p> Sales		    7.21 vs   7.19</p>
<p>JANUARY-FEBRUARY</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.80 vs   0.84</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 1.57 vs   1.74</p>
<p> Operating profit     1.53 vs   1.54</p>
<p> Sales		   15.31 vs  13.59</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish garment maker is Wolczanka SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
